  "description": {
   "en": "A white, round SOMETHING has appeared in the Sea of Japan!\nThe notoriously lazy Harusame gets appointed as the mysterious marine creature \"Shiromaru\" handler along with two quirky companions!\nWhile Harusame wants nothing more than to avoid human interaction, his encounters with Shiromaru force him to confront the past...\nA coming-of-age sci-fi drama for anyone who finds this world hard to live in!\n\n(Source: MangaPlus)",
   "ja": "しろくて、まあるい、ナニかが日本海にやってきた――！\nいわゆるサボり魔の春雨は愉快な仲間二人で謎の海洋生物“しろまる”係に任命されてしまって、さぁ大変！\n人と関わらずに逃げていきたい春雨は、しろまる関連のアレコレによって過去の自分と向き合う羽目に…\nこの世界が生きにくいアナタに送る人生青春SFドラマ！"
  },
